  "pli-tv-pvr10:57.3": "<a href='https://suttacentral.net/Sp 5.338/en/brahmali'>SP 5.338</a>: <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Tattha durāsadāti iminā tesaṁ sappaṭibhayataṁ dasseti</i>, “There <i lang='pi' translate='no'>durāsadā</i>: by this is shown their danger.” ",
