  "pli-tv-pvr10:61.3": "This probably refers to the monks’ five ways of reciting the Monastic Code, mentioned at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/pli-tv-kd2/en/brahmali#15.1.4'>Kd 2:15.1.4</a>, and then the four ways for nuns, referred to at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/pli-tv-pvr2.1/en/brahmali#1.8'>Pvr 2.1:1.8</a> and in the ensuing discussion. ",
